Description: Make Jinja syntax generation order deterministic
 The generator uses set.pop() to choose the next grammar. Python hash
 randomization changes that order between builds, and CMake consumes
 the dry-run output order when constructing the embedded syntax QRC.
 Select the lexicographically smallest pending grammar instead.
Author: SupraLINUX Build System <build@supralinux.invalid>
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-08-29
--- a/data/generators/generate_jinja.py
+++ b/data/generators/generate_jinja.py
@@ -264,7 +264,8 @@ def main():
         sys.exit(2)
 
     while to_do:
-        lang = to_do.pop()
+        lang = min(to_do)
+        to_do.remove(lang)
         out_file = os.path.join(args.output_dir,
                                 args.prefix + os.path.basename(xmls[lang]))
         infuse_header(grammars[lang], jinja.getroot(), args.xtra_ext)
